   "w": 760,
   "kind": "dark",
   "title": "Chronic pain: is the distress MORE than chronic pain? (distressing symptoms with abnormal thoughts, feelings or behaviours)",
   "lines": [
    "ASSESS EVERY patient first:",
    "history: duration, nature, physical AND psychological symptoms incl. SUICIDAL THOUGHTS, what was tried, effect on function",
    "review past investigations, new only if indicated · pain diary: rate the sensation and the distress SEPARATELY"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_no",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 176,
   "w": 684,
   "h": 96,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "NO: chronic pain",
   "lines": [
    "multimodal, multidisciplinary",
    "realistic, measurable goals · MANAGE, not cure",
    "start EARLY, before 12 weeks"
   ]
  },
  {
